# GRIET Feedback Auto Filler (Client-Side Version)

This version runs 100% inside the user's browser.
No backend required. No Selenium. No Python.

## Features
- Fills all text boxes with “4”
- Clicks submit automatically
- Accepts confirm popup
- Clean loading bar UI
- Works for all students
- Deployable on Vercel instantly

## How to Use
1. Deploy the project to Vercel
2. Open the website
3. Enter GRIET username + password
4. Click **Fill Feedback**
5. Automation completes inside browser
